From ee209b8eb5552fcaa39679235d0dad80ca802e6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dinesh <dinesh@kritvaos.in>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 02:55:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(decisions): record the Control Plane working direction
 (D-148, PD-020)

Adds D-148: RaaS remains the owner of the Control Plane capability and its
implementation responsibility, and the separate repository planned in D-144
remains the planned code location, pending confirmation during V2-M3
planning. This is a provisional, non-blocking working direction. D-144 is
not superseded. PD-020 stays open for the V2-M3 confirmation: its action
text now carries the working direction, V2-M3 joins its scope and D-148 its
evidence. Regenerates PENDING_DECISIONS.md. No repository, task, baseline,
weight, estimate, gate or credit change.

Tasks: None (record keeping; implements no task)
